OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need helping causes
OL,4,Aacross the south
OL,5,
OL,6,FFundraising activities are taking place
OL,7,Facross the south as part of this year's
OL,8,FBBC Children in Need.
OL,10,FChildren in Need supports more than
OL,11,F1,600 local charities across the UK,
OL,12,Fincluding projects in Oxfordshire,
OL,13,FBerkshire, Dorset, Hampshire, and the
OL,14,FIsle of Wight.
OL,16,FLast year's appeal raised more than
OL,17,F#45m to help children and young people
OL,18,Facross the UK, and this year's TV event
OL,19,Fwill be broadcast from 19:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
