OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will include the BBC Children in
OL,7,FNeed choir, which brings together 16
OL,8,Fyoung people from BBC Children in
OL,9,FNeed-funded projects across the UK,
OL,10,Fincluding Mabel, from Abingdon,
OL,11,FOxfordshire.
